いる。雛子の方の言動はお任せします。コミカル調かシリアス調かもお任せします。\n異世界の魔物参考：下記ページの「心凪のエリスロ」\nhttps://barrelwisdom.com/second-light/demons/ja\n\n両作品それぞれのファンに向けて布教できるきっかけになればいいと思うので、「#ブルリフ」とサイレントヒルfのタグがイラスト内に入ってるとありがたいです。\n\n何卒宜しくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SGginri1015/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c2a3f88e/uploads/origins/728687fb-8289-403b-8c7b-5f041eb0700f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=24e4183c77e6212fcff9bf332914eea8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c2a3f88e/uploads/origins/728687fb-8289-403b-8c7b-5f041eb0700f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=24e4183c77e6212fcff9bf332914eea8, https://si.imgix.net/c2a3f88e/uploads/origins/728687fb-8289-403b-8c7b-5f041eb0700f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a51c84291ffc7631189bd0ff27cd446d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c2a3f88e/uploads/origins/728687fb-8289-403b-8c7b-5f041eb0700f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=739075b68c9e492ca84d76afea40cb7b 3x", "genre": "comic", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SGginri1015/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/581a15eb/uploads/origins/afcd84fe-7abb-4bd5-8fbd-bf57768973f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3690a93e2955ecfa9b1041715f1b79e8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/581a15eb/uploads/origins/afcd84fe-7abb-4bd5-8fbd-bf57768973f1?